WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.725
The chapter's responsibility
table has one decider per row,

2
00:00:03.725 --> 00:00:07.025
the agency business owner,
and names who does the work.

3
00:00:07.025 --> 00:00:12.350
Identity engineering builds and runs the
credential checks, the attribute mappings,

4
00:00:12.350 --> 00:00:15.500
the authentication validation
and the lifecycle,

5
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:18.050
including disables and reconciliation.

6
00:00:18.050 --> 00:00:20.533
The sponsor does the work on eligibility,

7
00:00:20.533 --> 00:00:24.112
authorization and the evidence,
and requests suspensions.

8
00:00:24.112 --> 00:00:29.088
Security operations contains incidents
first and tells the business owner after.

9
00:00:29.088 --> 00:00:32.434
The ISSO is consulted on
proofing, credentials,

10
00:00:32.434 --> 00:00:36.812
incidents and evidence, and the
privacy office on attributes.

11
00:00:36.812 --> 00:00:40.137
The identity governance
officer owns the partner tenant

12
00:00:40.137 --> 00:00:43.462
list and is alerted to any
change in cross-tenant settings.

13
00:00:43.462 --> 00:00:47.741
On the partner's side, the partner
keeps its affiliation record accurate,

14
00:00:47.741 --> 00:00:51.521
issues and revokes credentials,
sends mover and leaver notices,

15
00:00:51.521 --> 00:00:54.430
and coordinates incidents
under the agreement.
